 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [809], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [210, 106], "pos": [3111.97412109375, 3907.193115234375], "widgets_values": [1024, 1024, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 817, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 818, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 500, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [501.842041015625, 166.2172088623047], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [3019.865966796875, 4029.2490234375], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 501, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#121212", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 18, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "分辨率选择器节点设置宽高比和百万像素目标，其中 1.0 MP 约为 1024x1024。Qwen-Image-2.1 原生生成 2K 图像，因此对于 2048x2048 的方形输出，将目标设置为约 4.0 MP。如需使用，则开启{If/Else Switch}中的“switch”为true，什么情况下用？不在原图编辑可用。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#C8C8C8"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MmuuaiGroupBypass", "title": "mmuuai分组忽略开关 · 5个分组", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [474.1532287597656, 154], "pos": [1490.9710693359375, 4926.58203125], "id": 528, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MmuuaiGroupBypass"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [500.554443359375, 228.33021545410156], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [1481.2164306640625, 5139.60595703125], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 504, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#121212", "borderRadius": 19, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 18, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.2, "text": "## 透明图像\n\n要生成透明图像，请按如下方式包裹提示语，并将中间部分替换为生成内容：\n---\n这是一张具有透明度的 RGBA 格式图像。`[您的描述]`。该图像具有 alpha 通道和透明背景。\n---\n保存为 PNG 格式以保留 alpha 通道。\n", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#C8C8C8"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## Size\nQwen Image 2.1 has native 2K (2048*2048) support for direct output.\n\n- resolution is a total pixel budget (not width or height). Aspect ratio is preserved.\n- Official default is 1024. The model supports up to 2048.\n- This template starts at 0: no resize beyond a multiple of 32.\n- Output follows image_1. Extra refs can differ in size or aspect.\n- custom_size off: canvas comes from the encode latent (image_1).\n- custom_size on: use ResolutionSelector width/height. Keep it close to the resized image_1 size, or the edit can shift.\n\n## Reference images\n- Up to 10 reference images (image_1 to image_10).\n- Mention them in the prompt as `<image1>`, `<image2>`, ...\n- image_1 is the edit target. The rest are references.\n\n## Custom settings\nIf you need custom settings, enter or unpack the subgraph to edit it. See the [Subgraph](https://docs.comfy.org/interface/features/subgraph) guide.\n\n## Parameters\n- prompt: edit instruction. Use `<image1>` ... `<image10>`.\n- negative_prompt: unused while cfg is 1.\n- cfg: keep 1 for the Qwen Image 2.1 official path. Raise it only if you use a negative prompt.\n- steps: Qwen Image 2.1 official pipeline uses about 40-50 with euler. This template starts at 25. More advanced samplers need fewer steps."], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Usage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [420, 620], "pos": [713.9156494140625, 4330.6640625], "id": 463, "properties": {"widget_ue_con